    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00084",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks about current symptoms and provides explicit reassurance that no red flags are present",
          "quote": "没有胸痛、呼吸困难、发烧或咳血"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00135",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly lists post-procedure warning symptoms and gives urgent-care instruction",
          "quote": "一旦出现，需联系医生"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor actively screened for chest pain, dyspnea, syncope, persistent palpitations, fever, hemoptysis, cough changes, and neurologic symptoms. The patient confirmed absence of these symptoms in multiple turns. The doctor gave explicit instruction to seek urgent care if any red flags appear. RC1 is fully met.",
